% A tempo change in a tune with several tracks: the conductor track, track
% 0, ends with the other tracks (GitHub issue #67).  It ended after them,
% later by the time of the last tempo change, so that the MIDI file had
% silence at its end.
% - Tune 1: two voices and two tempo changes.
% - Tune 2: a %%MIDI command between two tempo changes.  Such a command
%   resets the delay that the end of track 0 was written with.
X:1
T:Tempo changes in a tune with two voices
C:abc2midi test
M:4/4
L:1/4
Q:1/4=120
K:C
V:1
C D E F |[Q:1/4=90] G A B c |[Q:1/4=60] c B A G |]
V:2
C,4 | G,4 | C,4 |]

X:2
T:Tempo changes around a MIDI command
C:abc2midi test
M:4/4
L:1/4
Q:1/4=120
K:C
V:1
C D E F |[Q:1/4=90] G A B c |
%%MIDI program 5
c B A G |[Q:1/4=60] G4 |]
V:2
C,4 | G,4 | C,4 | C,4 |]
